WEBVTT

00:12:30.061 --> 00:12:33.425
There was a joke, originally,
about my graph that I left out, which is:

00:12:33.449 --> 00:12:34.606
You see all this math?

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:36.805
I'm just happy I was able
to add it up to 100,

00:12:36.829 --> 00:12:38.624
because that's my skill set.

00:12:38.648 --> 00:12:40.862
(Laughter)

00:12:40.886 --> 00:12:43.547
So you have these people aging,

00:12:43.571 --> 00:12:46.877
and now this is them today, or last year.

00:12:47.205 --> 00:12:50.150
And that's a powerful thing
to have, to be able to track this.

00:12:50.174 --> 00:12:52.976
I wish that I would have
this of my family.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:56.976
I know that one day my children
will be wondering --

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:59.239
or my grandchildren,
or my great-grandchildren,

00:12:59.263 --> 00:13:01.337
if I ever have children --